      "content": "Since I cannot directly access the proprietary text of the 2018 patent (10,456,789), I advise a targeted claim analysis is necessary to confirm the risk. You must compare the **specific mechanisms** of the \"asynchronous task scheduling logic\" in the 10,456,789 claims against the **specific structural and operational claims** of the new DNPU.\n\nA high risk of overlap exists if the 2018 patent claims the *method* of achieving low latency through a specific, shared scheduling pattern. If the new design uses a genuinely novel *implementation* or *interaction* of these scheduling techniques, I can help refine the claim language to emphasize that crucial technical difference.",
